<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#444444"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">{{{Recipient.FirstName}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">My name is Wileen and I am reaching out from the State Farm team at EverQuote. Kicking off the new year, I wanted to see what your plans were for Q1 and how EverQuote can help achieve those goals.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Based on the State Farm scorecard, State Farm agents have consistently averaged the highest close rate at EverQuote than with other vendors - this does already create a higher than normal demand which will most likely increase further with the recent subsidy news.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Great news - Our Lead Connection Services (</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">LCS</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">) which is new and available to State Farm Agents. This hybrid service combines live transfers with traditional data leads, connecting you directly with consumers who are qualified and ready for a quote. This is a proven system that has helped other carriers for over 4 years - now it's your turn to benefit.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Additionally, we've introduced a new loyalty credit to our Accelerated Growth Program (</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">AGP</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">) customers - qualifying agents will receive an account credit on a monthly basis as a token of appreciation for your partnership. These tools are designed to help you start the year strong, and I want to make sure you are taking full advantage.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-variant:normal"><span style="white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman',serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">If you have any questions or would like further clarification, feel free to reach out to me at my direct line or book some time with me on my calendar below for a day that works best for you.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
